WEBVTT

00:03.060 --> 00:06.110
I had no idea there were so many 
different stalls for New Year's!

00:06.480 --> 00:11.490
I've only ever been to smaller shrines, 
so I've never seen anything like this before.

00:12.570 --> 00:15.700
Shinozaki-san, look! 
They've got a shooting game!

00:19.830 --> 00:22.810
I'm so sorry! I was... not thinking...

00:22.810 --> 00:25.080
No, please, don't worry about it!

00:26.380 --> 00:31.090
<i>I'm making such a fuss, 
my kohai is going to think I'm childish.</i>

00:31.550 --> 00:35.020
<i>She's making such a fuss... 
Senpai's acting like a kid.</i>

00:34.130 --> 00:36.090
m 0 0 l 82 0 l 82 151 l 0 151

00:34.130 --> 00:36.090
<b>He
already
thought
it.</b>

00:40.270 --> 00:41.940
Do you think she's lost?

00:41.940 --> 00:43.230
Maybe.

00:44.810 --> 00:46.070
What's wrong?

00:46.980 --> 00:48.540
Where are your parents?

00:50.060 --> 00:51.580
I dunno...

00:53.250 --> 00:54.490
I see.

00:54.490 --> 00:57.110
You were very brave 
to hang in there on your own.

00:57.110 --> 01:00.490
I'll stay with you now, so don't worry.

01:07.900 --> 01:10.380
Looks like she is lost.

01:10.980 --> 01:13.380
That was really mature of you, Senpai.

01:14.650 --> 01:16.970
Well, of course! I'm an adult, after all.

01:17.640 --> 01:21.170
They've got a station for lost kids 
at the reception desk, right?

01:21.170 --> 01:22.890
Yeah! Let's go.

01:24.020 --> 01:26.210
Look there, Yutaka-san.

01:26.210 --> 01:27.030
Yeah.

01:27.650 --> 01:30.580
They look like parents 
with their child, don't they?!

01:30.580 --> 01:35.760
I can see it... my cute little sister, 
and her cute little daughter!

01:35.760 --> 01:38.210
Would you two stop fussing? It's childish.

01:39.420 --> 01:46.100
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

01:50.960 --> 01:55.720
My Tiny Senpai

01:56.470 --> 01:58.800
<i>We've got an emergency here</i>

01:59.220 --> 02:01.580
<i>Are you paying attention, me?</i>

02:01.970 --> 02:07.810
<i>There's someone other than me 
dancing around inside of my heart</i>

02:07.810 --> 02:10.060
<i>I want to talk to her</i>

02:10.560 --> 02:13.110
<i>I want to touch her</i>

02:13.110 --> 02:18.600
<i>Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down</i>

02:19.110 --> 02:21.820
<i>What in the world am I doing?</i>

02:21.820 --> 02:24.580
<i>You're right next to me</i>

02:24.580 --> 02:30.830
<i>And this is the perfect chance...</i>

02:31.580 --> 02:32.410
<i>HONEY</i>

02:32.410 --> 02:37.120
<i>I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste</i>

02:37.120 --> 02:40.330
<i>And I don't think I can ever escape</i>

02:40.330 --> 02:42.830
<i>I may as well just sink into it</i>

02:42.830 --> 02:43.660
<i>HONEY</i>

02:43.660 --> 02:48.430
<i>It's another day in your dazzling presence</i>

02:48.650 --> 02:51.430
<i>We may never be 
on the same page with this love but</i>

02:51.430 --> 02:57.870
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

03:09.250 --> 03:13.750
#07 You Sure You Don't Want One?

03:10.460 --> 03:12.640
<i>Time to start a new year of work.</i>

03:12.640 --> 03:13.860
Good morning!

03:15.060 --> 03:18.020
It's a pleasure to be 
working with you again, Senpai!

03:20.720 --> 03:25.000
Hearing you call me that makes me 
feel like it's time to get back to work.

03:25.000 --> 03:27.720
<i>If you like it, I can call you that 
whenever you like!</i>

03:28.220 --> 03:31.480
I have to say, New Year's went 
by in the blink of an eye.

03:31.480 --> 03:35.480
Considering you were a student last year, 
it probably seems even faster.

03:36.610 --> 03:39.390
<i>I feel like...</i>

03:40.400 --> 03:44.700
<i>the angle at which I'm looking up at 
Shinozaki-san is different from usual...</i>

03:42.400 --> 03:45.490
<b>Usual</b>

03:43.740 --> 03:45.490
<b>Today</b>

03:49.940 --> 03:54.520
<i>When I would see him before, 
my head was around here.</i>

03:54.520 --> 03:57.250
<i>Now I'm a little higher...</i>

03:57.250 --> 03:59.860
<i>Could it be?</i>

04:01.010 --> 04:04.210
<i>Have I gotten taller?!</i>

04:05.350 --> 04:06.640
Shinozaki-san.

04:06.970 --> 04:07.890
Yes?

04:09.500 --> 04:14.900
I'm a little different 
than usual today. Can you tell?

04:15.450 --> 04:17.770
<i>She's different?</i>

04:18.370 --> 04:20.700
<i>Her clothes and shoes are different,</i>

04:21.260 --> 04:25.250
<i>but I don't think she'd ask 
if it was something that obvious...</i>

04:26.250 --> 04:31.200
<i>Standard practice is to check nails, 
but those don't seem different...</i>

04:32.960 --> 04:34.960
You can't tell?

04:37.590 --> 04:39.150
<i>This scent...</i>

04:39.150 --> 04:40.270
<i>That's it!</i>

04:41.370 --> 04:43.630
Did you switch to a different shampoo?

04:45.380 --> 04:48.100
I did, but that's not what I meant!

04:49.530 --> 04:52.600
<i>I got it wrong! A pervert! 
She'll think I'm a pervert!</i>

04:52.930 --> 04:57.130
Shinozaki-san... 
you've been smelling my shampoo?

04:57.130 --> 04:59.110
<i>It's not like that, Senpai!</i>

04:59.110 --> 05:01.550
<i>I swear, it wasn't anything untoward...</i>

05:02.970 --> 05:06.360
<i>I'll need to be careful with my 
shampoo choices going forward...</i>

05:06.780 --> 05:09.870
<i>He seems really stumped.</i>

05:10.270 --> 05:13.370
<i>I should give him an obvious hint.</i>

05:13.690 --> 05:15.300
Okay, here's a hint.

05:16.650 --> 05:21.890
It's not my hair or anything in particular 
like that, but more my body as a whole.

05:22.770 --> 05:24.380
Your whole body?

05:25.900 --> 05:28.300
<i>Her whole... body...</i>

05:31.600 --> 05:35.770
<i>I just told my kohai 
to pay attention to my body!</i>

05:36.250 --> 05:39.270
That's what you're into, huh?

05:39.270 --> 05:42.780
<i>A pervert! He'll think I'm a pervert!</i>

05:45.780 --> 05:48.280
H-How about another hint?

05:48.710 --> 05:50.280
L-Let's see...

05:50.720 --> 05:54.910
Well, there's a big size difference between us.

05:55.430 --> 05:57.540
That should make it pretty clear.

05:58.410 --> 06:01.790
<i>A size difference... Th-Then maybe...</i>

06:03.230 --> 06:05.810
<i>You mean to say they've gotten even bigger?!</i>

06:06.700 --> 06:07.930
Did you figure it out?

06:08.840 --> 06:10.890
<i>It can't be that!</i>

06:11.430 --> 06:13.990
Well... I give up.

06:15.790 --> 06:18.190
Okay, here's the answer.

06:18.660 --> 06:20.190
It turns out...

06:20.620 --> 06:24.970
Ta-da! I'm a little bit taller!

06:26.250 --> 06:29.300
Now that you mention it, 
you do seem a bit taller...

06:30.910 --> 06:33.700
<i>The boots... That explains it.</i>

06:34.250 --> 06:37.010
Yeah, you're wearing 
boots for a change, after all.

06:38.750 --> 06:42.960
<b>My boots...</b>

06:38.830 --> 06:42.030
My boots... the soles...

06:40.250 --> 06:42.960
<b>the soles...</b>

06:43.090 --> 06:45.830
I'm just gonna sit here 
for the rest of the day.

06:46.340 --> 06:48.980
But maybe you did get a bit taller!

06:48.980 --> 06:51.510
You don't need to humor me.

06:51.510 --> 06:53.380
Well... Senpai...

06:53.380 --> 06:57.470
I thought I was getting taller... Sulk...

06:58.490 --> 06:59.980
Shinozaki-kun!

06:59.980 --> 07:01.060
Yes?

07:01.060 --> 07:05.980
I've got something I'd like you 
to take care of today...

07:02.480 --> 07:05.980
m 0 0 l 140 0 l 140 75 l 0 75

07:02.480 --> 07:05.980
<b>Public Relations
Ishiyama Satoshi</b>

07:05.980 --> 07:12.970
Well, Katase-san oversees my scheduling, 
so you'll need to talk to her.

07:12.970 --> 07:14.990
Don't be like that, Shinozaki-kun.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.690
They do say, "when you're young,

07:16.690 --> 07:18.750
you should tackle 
as many challenges as you can!"

07:20.300 --> 07:21.760
Pwease?

07:21.760 --> 07:23.750
Making a cute face doesn't change the answer!

07:23.750 --> 07:25.500
Unfortunately for you,

07:25.500 --> 07:30.760
we're not in the habit of accepting challenges 
that don't actually serve a purpose.

07:31.100 --> 07:32.450
Katase-san!

07:32.450 --> 07:33.510
Senpai.

07:33.510 --> 07:36.030
I-I thought you were in a meeting...

07:36.440 --> 07:40.520
Oh, so you asked Shinozaki-san about this 
because you thought I wasn't around?

07:40.520 --> 07:43.200
Catch you next time, Shinozaki-kun!

07:43.800 --> 07:46.450
Ishiyama-kun never changes, does he?

07:49.290 --> 07:50.530
An internal email?

07:50.530 --> 07:54.530
Sender:

07:50.530 --> 07:54.530
Ishiyama

07:50.530 --> 07:54.530
To:

07:50.530 --> 07:54.530
Me

07:50.530 --> 07:54.530
Subject:

07:50.530 --> 07:54.530
Our Discussion

07:50.530 --> 07:54.530
Wanna do it in secret?

07:51.170 --> 07:52.880
Wanna do it in secret?!

07:53.250 --> 07:54.530
He doesn't give up!

07:54.530 --> 07:55.800
Hiss!

07:55.800 --> 07:57.410
Hiss! Hiss! Hiss! Hiss!

07:57.950 --> 08:01.160
Please stop trying to assign work 
directly to my subordinates!

08:01.160 --> 08:04.400
But you wouldn't do it, Katase-san...

08:04.400 --> 08:06.180
I never said I wouldn't!

08:08.220 --> 08:09.580
But if you need something done,

08:09.580 --> 08:13.180
you need to talk to me first, 
so we can do things properly.

08:15.430 --> 08:16.680
You mean it?!

08:17.350 --> 08:19.430
In that case, I was wondering...

08:19.430 --> 08:23.330
Katase-san really is quite the reliable senpai.

08:19.780 --> 08:20.790
Okay.

08:20.790 --> 08:21.770
I see...

08:23.500 --> 08:26.680
This should be doable 
if we adjust the schedule.

08:24.650 --> 08:25.690
Yeah.

08:26.680 --> 08:29.020
Really?! Thank you!

08:29.690 --> 08:31.870
How'd your fortune turn out, Senpai?

08:33.030 --> 08:34.330
Not telling.

08:36.700 --> 08:39.910
<i>My Tiny Senpai</i>.

08:48.970 --> 08:51.730
<i>I'm still not used to being 
 here at night...</i>

08:54.640 --> 08:55.510
Whatcha doing?

08:56.950 --> 09:01.010
<i>My boss can seem to appear out of thin air.</i>

09:01.010 --> 09:05.030
D-Don't scare me like that! 
I thought you were a ghost or something.

09:05.030 --> 09:06.410
Sorry, sorry.

09:06.990 --> 09:09.630
But why are you working late 
by yourself if you're scared?

09:10.050 --> 09:11.900
Were you really that busy?

09:13.390 --> 09:14.400
Well...

09:14.820 --> 09:16.310
Pwease?

09:16.850 --> 09:20.890
Ishiyama-san in PR said 
he needed this tomorrow...

09:21.490 --> 09:24.490
Did he get approval from 
your supervisor for this?

09:25.310 --> 09:27.300
Hayakawa-san...

09:27.300 --> 09:29.130
I know, I know!

09:29.440 --> 09:32.130
He asked me right at the end of the day

09:32.130 --> 09:35.840
and said there was no one else 
he could turn to.

09:35.840 --> 09:39.850
Even so, fundamentally speaking, you really 
shouldn't accept assignments on your own.

09:39.850 --> 09:42.330
Especially since you're new. Ask first.

09:42.330 --> 09:43.140
Okay.

09:43.730 --> 09:46.450
But I thought, if I could just 
get it done in secret...

09:46.450 --> 09:47.410
Still no.

09:47.770 --> 09:51.770
That'd just mean he's taking advantage 
of how nice you are, Hayakawa-san.

09:57.280 --> 10:01.340
And speaking as a manager, 
it's not nice at all!

10:02.150 --> 10:03.290
You're completely right.

10:03.610 --> 10:06.290
I'll have a word with Ishiyama-kun.

10:06.290 --> 10:08.290
Sorry about all this...

10:08.730 --> 10:10.690
Well, it's part of the job.

10:11.050 --> 10:11.830
Um...

10:14.890 --> 10:16.610
I really appreciate it.

10:18.050 --> 10:21.140
What?! What's wrong?! You okay?!

10:21.140 --> 10:22.570
Sorry...

10:23.570 --> 10:28.470
It's just, having someone looking out 
for me... made me so glad, y'know?

10:29.060 --> 10:31.630
It's a real relief.

10:33.940 --> 10:35.130
One second.

10:36.740 --> 10:37.450
Here.

10:38.310 --> 10:39.820
Thank you.

10:43.330 --> 10:45.340
Have you eaten anything?

10:45.340 --> 10:47.330
It was a rush job, so...

10:47.690 --> 10:49.580
How much longer do you think it'll be?

10:49.880 --> 10:51.850
I just need to submit it and I'll be done.

10:51.850 --> 10:52.580
So fast!

10:52.980 --> 10:56.090
If you've got time, 
do you wanna grab something to eat?

10:57.110 --> 10:58.090
You sure?

10:58.830 --> 11:01.820
Consider it a little reward 
for a hard worker who made a mistake.

11:05.300 --> 11:08.470
<i>How can he just say stuff like that...?</i>

11:13.510 --> 11:15.520
The entrance made it look like 
modern residence,

11:15.520 --> 11:17.010
but it's got an old fashioned Japanese style.

11:17.010 --> 11:19.110
Kinda surprising, right?

11:19.110 --> 11:21.240
Tempting to just space out, taking it in.

11:22.620 --> 11:25.990
<i>What?! Why did he just sit next to me?</i>

11:25.990 --> 11:27.480
<i>Is this a move?</i>

11:27.480 --> 11:29.710
<i>Is he pulling some kind of move on me?!</i>

11:29.040 --> 11:31.000
*Not really
thinking about it

11:31.000 --> 11:34.000
<b>Beers</b>

11:31.080 --> 11:34.000
<b>Non-alcoholic</b>

11:31.120 --> 11:34.000
<b>Drink Menu</b>

11:32.470 --> 11:34.000
What a big non-alcoholic selection!

11:34.410 --> 11:37.330
I had no idea there was somewhere 
like this so close to the office.


11:37.330 --> 11:41.760
I noticed you almost never drink 
when we have drinking parties,

11:42.130 --> 11:44.260
so I thought you might enjoy it a bit more.

11:45.170 --> 11:47.420
<i>Are you trying to be the ideal guy right now?</i>

11:48.270 --> 11:51.450
What percentage of the office 
has confessed to you before?

11:51.450 --> 11:53.330
Not <i>that</i> many!

11:53.790 --> 11:55.870
<i>Didn't deny that he's been approached, though.</i>

11:58.290 --> 12:02.130
Manager... you never really talk about 
your romantic history, do you?

12:03.210 --> 12:05.180
No one really asks.

12:07.790 --> 12:08.870
If I asked...

12:10.330 --> 12:12.650
If I asked, would you tell me?

12:14.300 --> 12:15.350
You wanna know?

12:19.430 --> 12:21.900
I don't mean anything untoward by it!

12:21.900 --> 12:23.580
Untoward how?

12:23.580 --> 12:25.930
<i>Is this just him? Is he just a ditz...?</i>

12:27.170 --> 12:28.950
Romance, huh...?

12:29.940 --> 12:34.620
When I was younger, I didn't really 
understand how it felt to like someone.

12:34.620 --> 12:37.710
I tried dating quite a few times 
up through college,

12:37.710 --> 12:40.970
but in the end, I never really found love.

12:42.210 --> 12:46.590
I think my life might just be one 
with no romance to speak of.

12:47.710 --> 12:48.860
<i>Manager...</i>

12:50.060 --> 12:51.090
<i>Is that why?</i>

12:52.010 --> 12:53.080
The thing is...

12:54.700 --> 12:59.090
Nothing makes me happier than 
cheering on someone else's love life.

13:02.060 --> 13:04.620
I'm more curious about your 
romantic history, Hayakawa-san!

13:05.340 --> 13:06.650
M-Me...?

13:06.650 --> 13:09.250
Now that reaction makes me curious!

13:09.250 --> 13:10.050
Oho.

13:10.600 --> 13:13.450
I thought I recognized that voice.

13:13.450 --> 13:14.600
Yutaka-san!

13:15.030 --> 13:17.160
Is your office around here?

13:17.160 --> 13:20.860
Indeed. In the opposite direction of 
the station, though, so it's a bit of a walk.

13:21.750 --> 13:25.360
Some coworkers dragged me this way, 
but I've never been one for big groups.

13:26.010 --> 13:28.370
So I slipped out, but then realized...

13:28.830 --> 13:30.880
It's lonely to be on your own!

13:30.880 --> 13:31.870
<i>So free-spirited!</i>

13:31.870 --> 13:35.280
That being the case, 
would you mind if I joined you?

13:35.280 --> 13:36.210
Go ahead.

13:38.010 --> 13:39.810
If you'll excuse me...

13:41.470 --> 13:43.000
Gimme pics of Shiorin!

13:42.300 --> 13:45.370
<i>Come on, what am I getting so anxious about?</i>

13:43.000 --> 13:44.970
Ask to your brother.

13:44.970 --> 13:46.450
Besides, I don't have any.

13:45.370 --> 13:48.890
<i>All she did was sit 
in an empty seat, normally...</i>

13:46.970 --> 13:48.000
Is that right?

13:48.000 --> 13:48.890
It is.

13:49.260 --> 13:50.660
<i>Normally...</i>

13:51.330 --> 13:52.510
Chika-chan?

13:55.460 --> 13:57.020
I think I'll sit here instead.

13:57.020 --> 14:00.280
Just sit across the table 
like a normal person!

14:00.280 --> 14:01.020
Don't wanna.

14:01.360 --> 14:03.490
I could see a wish for me to 
sit here in those eyes.

14:03.490 --> 14:04.860
Whose?!

14:04.860 --> 14:05.960
Yours.

14:05.960 --> 14:06.960
Well, you're wrong!

14:06.960 --> 14:07.820
I saw it.

14:10.050 --> 14:13.910
I guess... she didn't want to sit next to me.

14:14.350 --> 14:16.290
Maybe I'll sit here, after all.

14:16.290 --> 14:18.330
O-Onee-san...

14:19.730 --> 14:21.710
In that case, I'll just sit over here.

14:22.170 --> 14:24.090
You should sit here, Manager.

14:24.090 --> 14:25.960
No, no, that's for you, Yutaka-san.

14:25.960 --> 14:26.970
No, no...

14:26.970 --> 14:29.090
<i>What's with these two?</i>

14:29.360 --> 14:30.340
Hayakawa-san.

14:30.760 --> 14:31.600
Chika-chan.

14:32.180 --> 14:34.600
If I'm interrupting, 
I'll head on home, so let me know.

14:37.520 --> 14:40.450
Both of you sit down over there!

14:40.450 --> 14:41.190
Okay.

14:41.190 --> 14:42.810
Unbelievable...

14:42.810 --> 14:44.610
You're really pouring it back, Chika-chan!

14:44.610 --> 14:46.010
Are you a big drinker?

14:46.010 --> 14:47.140
This is nonalcoholic!

14:47.140 --> 14:48.920
I see. Yet, you're still red.

14:48.350 --> 14:49.660
Oh, my!

14:48.920 --> 14:50.220
Shut up!

14:56.570 --> 14:58.550
<i>My body feels heavy for some reason...</i>

14:59.310 --> 15:01.330
<i>Is this sleep paralysis?</i>

15:01.900 --> 15:05.090
Li'l Bro. Gimme some Shiorin-senpai pics.

15:05.620 --> 15:11.590
It's just you?! And could you not barge 
into your brother's place on his day off?!

15:12.140 --> 15:13.970
And... pictures of Senpai?

15:14.380 --> 15:17.470
Correct. Shiorin's fluffiness 
won't leave my mind.

15:17.880 --> 15:21.240
I want to have a picture on hand 
so I can air-fluff her at all times.

15:21.240 --> 15:22.600
What kind of reason is that?!

15:22.930 --> 15:25.790
And what are those hand movements?

15:25.790 --> 15:27.110
Air-fluffing.

15:27.440 --> 15:30.110
Yes, quite fluffy indeed.

15:28.910 --> 15:30.110
Oh, that.

15:30.110 --> 15:34.460
Anyway, I don't have any pics 
of Senpai in the first place.

15:34.460 --> 15:35.800
Then get some.

15:35.800 --> 15:37.990
You should ask Hayakawa instead.

15:37.990 --> 15:43.250
Gimme Shiorin pics.

15:37.990 --> 15:43.250
No way.
Ask your brother.

15:37.990 --> 15:43.250
<b>Gimme</b>

15:37.990 --> 15:43.250
<b>No way</b>

15:38.280 --> 15:40.500
Your manager said to task you.

15:40.500 --> 15:43.250
Since when are you and my boss buddies?!

15:43.980 --> 15:45.250
<i>Though, you're right...</i>

15:46.090 --> 15:49.010
We could... show each other...

15:49.010 --> 15:52.760
We could send each other 
pictures of us wearing them!

15:53.690 --> 15:58.770
<i>We never did end up sending pics 
of us wearing that loungewear...</i>

15:59.690 --> 16:02.130
<i>And I can't deny I'd like to see that...</i>

16:02.560 --> 16:03.370
Yoink!

16:04.500 --> 16:05.550
Sent!

16:06.340 --> 16:07.770
What did you just send?!

16:10.890 --> 16:12.530
Something from Shinozaki-san?

16:13.070 --> 16:16.480
<i>"I miss you on the weekend..."</i>

16:16.480 --> 16:20.200
<i>"Could you please send a picture 
so I can see you whenever I want?"</i>

16:20.200 --> 16:23.160
<i>Wh-Wh-Where did this
come from all of a sudden?!</i>

16:23.160 --> 16:26.920
<i>A-A-A-Am I dreaming?! 
Am I still asleep right now?!</i>

16:29.300 --> 16:31.550
<i>I should bathe first...</i>

16:31.550 --> 16:34.210
My phone!

16:34.210 --> 16:36.350
Okay, I've got it back.

16:37.430 --> 16:40.180
Great, it's already marked as read!

16:37.430 --> 16:40.180
Read

16:40.560 --> 16:41.520
Yay!

16:41.520 --> 16:45.190
Senpai, it's a trick! 
That was my sister! I didn't say that!

16:47.770 --> 16:49.940
I'm so sorry!
My sister sent that!
You can ignore it.

16:50.700 --> 16:53.830
His sister? That explains it.

17:02.370 --> 17:03.790
She replied!

17:03.790 --> 17:06.370
...You sure
you don't want one?

17:04.410 --> 17:06.370
<i>You sure you don't want one?</i>

17:07.880 --> 17:09.920
Manager

17:08.330 --> 17:09.330
Ask for it!

17:09.330 --> 17:10.170
<i>Do it!</i>

17:10.170 --> 17:12.010
Could the peanut gallery pipe down?!

17:13.840 --> 17:16.340
I'm so sorry!
My sister sent that!
You can ignore it.

17:13.840 --> 17:16.340
...You sure
you don't want one?

17:14.970 --> 17:16.340
<i>I actually sent that...</i>

17:16.770 --> 17:20.450
<i>And now if he says he wants a picture, 
I should probably send one.</i>

17:29.110 --> 17:31.190
<i>Sending a picture to Shinozaki-san.</i>

17:33.360 --> 17:36.110
<i>Huh? All of a sudden...</i>

17:36.110 --> 17:39.200
<i>I'm feeling really embarrassed!</i>

17:39.500 --> 17:42.450
<i>Sending someone else a selfie like this...</i>

17:42.450 --> 17:46.730
<i>Who even does that 
unless you're going out already?!</i>

17:48.120 --> 17:50.040
{also sign}"Senpai, I'm sorry."

17:50.770 --> 17:52.550
<i>He's gonna say he wants one!</i>

17:53.570 --> 17:55.630
"I'm busy, so I'll be back later!"

17:57.630 --> 18:02.390
<i>I'm partly relieved and partly frustrated! 
Why am I so conflicted?!</i>

18:05.070 --> 18:08.620
You had better apologize 
to Senpai for bothering her.

18:08.620 --> 18:09.650
Consider it done!

18:12.090 --> 18:14.280
From Shinozaki-san's sister?

18:14.890 --> 18:19.280
<i>Shiorin... Sorry about earlier. 
Allow me to make amends...</i>

18:21.530 --> 18:23.280
<i>My sleeping brother.</i>

18:25.310 --> 18:26.860
<i>My brother drinking bubble tea.</i>

18:28.170 --> 18:29.620
<i>My brother with a kitty.</i>

18:30.700 --> 18:32.090
<i>My brother, running.</i>

18:32.500 --> 18:33.690
<i>My brother, with sushi.</i>

18:34.120 --> 18:35.410
<i>My brother, stretching.</i>

18:34.290 --> 18:37.590
<i>Sh-She keeps sending pictures 
of Shinozaki-san...!</i>

18:35.870 --> 18:37.250
<i>My brother, writing.</i>

18:37.930 --> 18:39.220
<i>My brother, in the bath.</i>

18:39.220 --> 18:41.470
<i>Wait... in the bath...</i>

18:41.470 --> 18:46.220
<i>W-W-Wouldn't that mean 
Shinozaki-san is... n-na...</i>

18:46.820 --> 18:48.160
<i>Naked?</i>

18:48.160 --> 18:49.350
<i>Age 3.</i>

18:49.810 --> 18:52.360
What do you think you're doing?!

18:58.010 --> 19:02.740
<i>I never did hear back from Senpai yesterday.</i>

19:02.740 --> 19:04.060
Shinozaki-san.

19:04.620 --> 19:07.120
Good morning, Shinozaki-san!

19:07.660 --> 19:09.870
G-G-Good morning.

19:10.180 --> 19:13.380
Um... I'm sorry about 
how my sister acted yesterday.

19:13.380 --> 19:14.700
It's quite all right.

19:14.700 --> 19:18.270
And... about that picture you mentioned...

19:19.950 --> 19:23.010
If it's not too much trouble, 
I'd be really glad to receive one!

19:25.720 --> 19:29.670
<i>I said it! I actually said it! 
There's no turning back now!</i>

19:36.290 --> 19:37.810
When I stop and think about it,

19:37.810 --> 19:40.910
there's something embarrassing 
about taking a picture of yourself.

19:41.740 --> 19:45.190
<i>After all this, am I stuck on the 
"I changed my mind" path?!</i>

19:45.190 --> 19:46.290
Therefore...

19:47.730 --> 19:50.030
why don't we take one together?

19:52.290 --> 19:54.080
You and I?

19:54.080 --> 19:55.000
Right!

19:55.000 --> 19:59.980
That way, it won't be a picture of just me, 
but a picture with you in it, too.

19:59.980 --> 20:01.300
Senpai!

20:01.300 --> 20:02.250
Great idea!

20:02.250 --> 20:03.060
Manager?!

20:03.060 --> 20:04.010
How long have you been there?!

20:04.750 --> 20:05.890
Okay!

20:05.890 --> 20:10.310
Shinozaki-kun, 
get a little closer to Katase-san!

20:14.310 --> 20:16.940
I-Is there a reason I need to get closer?!

20:16.940 --> 20:18.440
There sure is!

20:18.440 --> 20:21.160
Are you nervous, Shinozaki-san?

20:21.160 --> 20:21.890
Yeah!

20:24.990 --> 20:26.820
To be honest...

20:27.380 --> 20:29.530
I'm kind of nervous, too.

20:31.130 --> 20:32.460
<i>Does that mean...?</i>

20:32.830 --> 20:33.990
Here we go!

20:34.330 --> 20:36.220
Say cheese!

20:38.910 --> 20:39.770
How's that?

20:40.090 --> 20:42.090
Great! It turned out nicely.

20:42.730 --> 20:46.190
<i>I was actually in a pair shot with Senpai!</i>

20:47.230 --> 20:50.480
Huh? What're you all doing?

20:50.480 --> 20:51.720
Hayakawa-san!

20:51.720 --> 20:55.010
Since you're here, 
you should take one with us, too!

20:55.010 --> 20:55.730
What?

20:56.190 --> 20:58.330
You get in here, too, Manager!

20:58.330 --> 20:59.190
Me, too?

21:00.150 --> 21:01.940
Does a five second timer sound good?

21:01.940 --> 21:02.930
Yes!

21:02.930 --> 21:03.660
Sure.

21:03.660 --> 21:06.700
Wait, what are we doing?!

21:04.100 --> 21:06.140
Hurry up, Hayakawa-san!

21:06.700 --> 21:08.950
D-Smart Pharmaceuticals

21:12.500 --> 21:15.250
<b>Lil Bro</b>

21:12.500 --> 21:15.250
<b>Sending pictures of
Senpai etc.</b>

21:13.940 --> 21:15.250
<i>A picture of Senpai!</i>

21:15.250 --> 21:19.750
<i>So, Li'l Bro, you finally have 
a picture of Shiorin-senpai!</i>

21:20.390 --> 21:21.250
<i>But...</i>

21:21.910 --> 21:23.510
<i>What's this "etc." mean?</i>

21:28.410 --> 21:33.020
I-I want in on this! I feel left out!

21:46.350 --> 21:50.230
<i>Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream</i>

21:50.230 --> 21:55.130
<i>I still can't bring myself 
to drink that bitter coffee</i>

21:55.690 --> 21:59.610
<i>So I sneakily toss in 
two pinches of a sweet secret</i>

21:59.610 --> 22:03.830
<i>And let it slowly spread throughout</i>

22:05.050 --> 22:08.790
<i>There's a local bakery 
that's only open sometimes</i>

22:08.790 --> 22:13.680
<i>Where I once had some toast that glittered</i>

22:14.340 --> 22:18.180
<i>What is it that makes it so satisfying?</i>

22:18.180 --> 22:22.350
<i>Almost like magic</i>

22:22.770 --> 22:27.430
<i>I find myself thinking about that kind of thing</i>

22:27.430 --> 22:33.030
<i>How the small things can be the most precious</i>

22:33.790 --> 22:37.830
<i>Deep inside my heart</i>

22:37.830 --> 22:42.230
<i>It's ever so bittersweet</i>

22:43.100 --> 22:47.150
<i>"Just being around you is enough"</i>

22:47.150 --> 22:51.170
<i>Becomes my mantra</i>

22:51.170 --> 22:53.460
<i>Baby like sugar</i>

23:00.560 --> 23:02.790
<i>Baby you're the sugar</i>
